Você.

28
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:16,301
Eu?

29
00:11:21,598 --> 00:11:24,643
Não.

30
00:11:25,685 --> 00:11:27,270
Ok.

31
00:11:28,522 --> 00:11:31,023
Só me leve até o ouro,

32
00:11:31,024 --> 00:11:33,527
