Me ajude!

34
00:11:36,988 --> 00:11:39,408
Fique aí mesmo.

35
00:11:40,534 --> 00:11:41,993
Fique.

36
00:11:44,496 --> 00:11:47,666
<i>Little, aqui, agora!</i>

37
00:11:59,594 --> 00:12:01,388
