60
00:13:42,322 --> 00:13:45,407
Eu posso dar uma olhada lá.

61
00:13:45,408 --> 00:13:47,076
Tá bom, leve o Kitten.

62
00:13:47,077 --> 00:13:48,577
Kitten.

63
